     "Snip the dried chilies into pieces and shake out most of the seeds.",
     "Heat the oil in the wok until very hot. Fry the chicken in batches until deep golden and crisp. Lift out.",
     "Pour off all but two tablespoons of oil. Over low heat, fry the chilies and Sichuan peppercorns until fragrant and darkening, without burning them.",
     "Add the garlic, ginger and scallion, return the chicken, and toss with the sugar and sesame seeds."
